{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Message from the Developer:</strong><br>Welcome to the challenging journey of the game.<br>I\u2019m sure you already know W, A, S, D, space, and sprint \u2014 but I\u2019ll remind you anyway.<br>Due to the game\u2019s intense difficulty, we\u2019ve made a few adjustments and slight easings.<br>You might think something is a bug, but trust me \u2014 everything is intentionally placed.<br>And yes\u2026 the game <i>is</i> fully completable.<br>Now, are you truly ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any situation, feel free to contact us at <strong><a href=\"mailto:ssyphusgames@gmail.com\">ssyphusgames@gmail.com</a></strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;UP&quot;</strong> is a fast-paced platformer that challenges your reflexes, jumping skills, climbing ability, and quick decision-making. In this vertical world filled with towering structures and dangerous platforms, you have only one goal: <strong>go up</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With mechanics that are easy to learn but hard to master, UP delivers a sense of growth and mastery step by step. Whether you're a speedrunner or a strategic thinker, you'll face increasingly difficult challenges as you climb. Timing, direction, and jump angles will determine your success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Reflex-Based Parkour Mechanics</strong><br>Fast and fluid movement system including jumping, platforming, and quick navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Endless Ascent in a Vertical World</strong><br>Each level pushes you higher. How far can you climb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Deadly Traps and Challenging Obstacles</strong><br>Watch your step! Hidden traps and moving platforms will test your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd35 <strong>Minimalist and Aesthetic Design</strong><br>Clean yet striking visuals keep you focused on the atmosphere and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready? Jump, climb, ascend... and never fall. Because in this world, there\u2019s only one way: UP.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Zirveye Ula\u015ft\u0131","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826240/520a7de6a4979174b3d15b4eb77bb0129a5e3907.jpg"},{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826240/078a3dc585b460b6cb2df788ec095b100d304969.jpg"},{"name":"Land Of Ancients","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826240/25aa9fd8c3c14056d90af5999237367982cff761.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826240?t=1761774929","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826240?t=1761774929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826240/60f399fb9027ed21c0760ccd6ea3fb9c2faf0b0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761774929","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826240/60f399fb9027ed21c0760ccd6ea3fb9c2faf0b0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761774929","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Message from the Developer:</strong><br>Welcome to the challenging journey of the game.<br>I\u2019m sure you already know W, A, S, D, space, and sprint \u2014 but I\u2019ll remind you anyway.<br>Due to the game\u2019s intense difficulty, we\u2019ve made a few adjustments and slight easings.<br>You might think something is a bug, but trust me \u2014 everything is intentionally placed.<br>And yes\u2026 the game <i>is</i> fully completable.<br>Now, are you truly ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any situation, feel free to contact us at <strong><a href=\"mailto:ssyphusgames@gmail.com\">ssyphusgames@gmail.com</a></strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;UP&quot;</strong> is a fast-paced platformer that challenges your reflexes, jumping skills, climbing ability, and quick decision-making. In this vertical world filled with towering structures and dangerous platforms, you have only one goal: <strong>go up</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With mechanics that are easy to learn but hard to master, UP delivers a sense of growth and mastery step by step. Whether you're a speedrunner or a strategic thinker, you'll face increasingly difficult challenges as you climb. Timing, direction, and jump angles will determine your success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Reflex-Based Parkour Mechanics</strong><br>Fast and fluid movement system including jumping, platforming, and quick navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Endless Ascent in a Vertical World</strong><br>Each level pushes you higher. How far can you climb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Deadly Traps and Challenging Obstacles</strong><br>Watch your step! Hidden traps and moving platforms will test your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd35 <strong>Minimalist and Aesthetic Design</strong><br>Clean yet striking visuals keep you focused on the atmosphere and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready? Jump, climb, ascend... and never fall. Because in this world, there\u2019s only one way: UP.</strong></p>","developers":["ssyphus","Silvain"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"h